* Tumor reduction \ 14 days from the date of signing the informed consent form; 7. Hemoglobin (HGB) ≥ 60 g/L (transfusion allowed); 8. Absolute neutrophil count (ANC) ≥ 1,000/μl and platelet count ≥ 45,000/μl in peripheral blood (transfusion allowed); 9. Hepatic, renal, cardiac, and pulmonary functions meeting the following requirements:

